---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '14 May 2025';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | BBTea.sg"
  description="Terms of Service for BBTea.sg — Singapore's bubble tea directory. Read our terms before using the site."
  canonical="https://bbtea.sg/terms"
>

  <section class="bg-white border-b border-[var(--color-stone-200)] py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-400)] flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[var(--color-stone-900)] transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--color-stone-700)] font-medium">Terms of Service</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-display font-bold leading-tight mb-3">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-400)]">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <div class="prose-content space-y-10 text-[var(--color-stone-600)] leading-relaxed">

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using <strong>bbtea.sg</strong> (the "Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site. These terms are governed by the laws of Singapore.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">2. About BBTea.sg</h2>
        <p>
          BBTea.sg is a free, independently operated editorial directory of bubble tea shops in Singapore. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any bubble tea brand, mall operator, or food delivery platform listed on the Site.
        </p>
        <p>
          Listings are compiled from publicly available information and our own research. We strive for accuracy but cannot guarantee that all information (including opening hours, pricing, halal status, or outlet locations) is current or complete.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">3. Use of the Site</h2>
        <p>You may use BBTea.sg for personal, non-commercial purposes. You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Scrape, crawl, or systematically extract data from the Site without our prior written consent</li>
          <li>Reproduce or republish our editorial content, listings data, or design for commercial purposes without permission</li>
          <li>Use the Site in any way that violates applicable Singapore laws or regulations</li>
          <li>Attempt to interfere with or disrupt the Site's infrastructure or security</li>
          <li>Misrepresent your affiliation with any person or entity</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">4. Accuracy of Information</h2>
        <p>
          We make reasonable efforts to keep directory listings accurate, but bubble tea shop details — including addresses, operating hours, menu items, and halal certifications — can change without notice. Always verify directly with the outlet before visiting, especially for time-sensitive or dietary requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
          BBTea.sg accepts no liability for losses or inconvenience caused by reliance on inaccurate or outdated information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All original content on BBTea.sg — including editorial text, descriptions, page layouts, and the BBTea.sg name and logo — is owned by or licensed to BBTea.sg and protected under Singapore copyright law. You may not copy, reproduce, or adapt this content without our express written permission.
        </p>
        <p>
          Brand names, logos, and trademarks of bubble tea brands referenced on the Site belong to their respective owners. Their appearance on BBTea.sg does not imply any endorsement or commercial relationship.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">6. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          The Site contains links to external websites (brand homepages, Google Maps, food delivery platforms, and others). These links are provided for convenience only. BBTea.sg does not endorse these sites and is not responsible for their content, privacy practices, or availability.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The Site is provided on an <strong>"as is" and "as available"</strong> basis without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.
        </p>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by Singapore law, we disclaim all warranties, including implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, BBTea.sg and its operators shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of — or inability to use — the Site or any content on it, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">9. Listing Requests and Corrections</h2>
        <p>
          Bubble tea brands or outlet operators who wish to add, update, or remove a listing may contact us. We review all requests at our discretion and do not guarantee inclusion or removal.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">10. Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Your use of the Site is also governed by our <a href="/privacy" class="text-[var(--color-forest-700)] underline hover:text-[var(--color-forest-800)] transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>, which is incorporated into these Terms by reference.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">11. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may revise these Terms at any time. Updated terms will be posted on this page with a revised "Last updated" date. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">12. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Singapore. Any disputes arising from these Terms or your use of the Site shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the Singapore courts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-[var(--color-stone-900)]">13. Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these Terms, please reach us at:</p>
        <div class="bg-[var(--color-cream-100)] rounded-lg p-5 text-sm space-y-1">
          <p class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-stone-800)]">BBTea.sg</p>
          <p>Singapore</p>
          <p>
            Email: <a href="mailto:hello@bbtea.sg" class="text-[var(--color-forest-700)] underline hover:text-[var(--color-forest-800)] transition-colors">hello@bbtea.sg</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
